  "decision": "Retain v610 as the current source-true technical verification frame. It preserves the accepted v595 spray distribution, v600 source-equivalent boulder restoration, v601 skeletal-neoprene override, and v606 captured-sky fill. It also fixes the focused raft-material authoring path for static-mesh use and raises only the saturated raft wet-film roughness, preserving the authored red material while slightly softening the mirror-like response without changing raft geometry, D4, rescue, or water authority. Reject v610 for photoreal, marketing, store, press, and human approval because character anatomy and integration, PPE, parametric raft construction and remaining broad highlight, boulder, broad water, aerosol, shoreline, terrain, and overall lighting remain visibly synthetic or unfinished."
